 "carousel_html": "<div class=\"qc-sd-carousel\" data-qc-sd-carousel=\"\"> <div class=\"qc-sd-deck\"> <div class=\"qc-sd-stage\" data-qc-sd-stage=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"min-height: 168px;\"><article class=\"qc-sd-card is-active\" data-qc-sd-depth=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"z-index: 50;\"><span class=\"qc-sd-card-icon\"><img src=\"/documents/37246/0/strategic-pillar-vision+%281%29+%289%29.svg/595afb05-aa1e-66d7-0bb5-0930f05e32ef?version=1.0&amp;t=1790835087442&amp;download=true&amp;groupExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-SITE-qatar-chamber&amp;objectDefinitionExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD&amp;objectEntryExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD-01\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div class=\"qc-sd-card-body\"><h3 class=\"qc-sd-card-title\">Vision</h3><div class=\"qc-sd-card-desc\"><p>To achieve global leadership among chambers of commerce by advancing Qatar National Vision 2030, empowering the private sector, and positioning Qatar as a gateway for local and international business opportunities.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"qc-sd-card\" data-qc-sd-depth=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"z-index: 49; transform-origin: center bottom; transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.94);\"><span class=\"qc-sd-card-icon\"><img src=\"/documents/37246/0/strategic-pillar-mission+%281%29+%289%29.svg/488eaf10-93d4-ab8a-8e99-bb0995c32eca?version=1.0&amp;t=1790835087697&amp;download=true&amp;groupExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-SITE-qatar-chamber&amp;objectDefinitionExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD&amp;objectEntryExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD-02\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div class=\"qc-sd-card-body\"><h3 class=\"qc-sd-card-title\">Mission</h3><div class=\"qc-sd-card-desc\"><p>To empower Qatar's private sector by representing its interests, delivering high-quality services, and building partnerships that strengthen the national economy and expand trade opportunities at home and abroad.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"qc-sd-card\" data-qc-sd-depth=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"z-index: 48; transform-origin: center bottom; transform: translateY(36px) scale(0.88);\"><span class=\"qc-sd-card-icon\"><img src=\"/documents/37246/0/strategic-pillar-objectives+%281%29+%289%29.svg/41d07894-3c55-ba2c-3f3a-78c5ce1ab257?version=1.0&amp;t=1790835087910&amp;download=true&amp;groupExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-SITE-qatar-chamber&amp;objectDefinitionExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD&amp;objectEntryExternalReferenceCode=QCDEMO-129381-STRATEGIC_PILLAR_CARD-03\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div class=\"qc-sd-card-body\"><h3 class=\"qc-sd-card-title\">Objectives</h3><div class=\"qc-sd-card-desc\"><p>To foster a competitive business environment, support entrepreneurs and investors, promote Qatari products in global markets, and contribute to sustainable economic growth aligned with national priorities.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"qc-sd-card\" data-q",
